  "note": "Normative rev-5 recovery conformance cases for UM-B1/B2/B3. Cases marked rev4_expected_failure=true are historical red-first evidence: under rev-5 their expectation is the accepted/defined behavior shown here. Implemented in UM-B1/B2/B3 with automated tests; schema/vector checks must be real, not JSON-parse-only.",
  "slices": {
    "UM-B1": "protocol library + SQLite store + migrations + frozen vector regression",
    "UM-B2": "ingest listener, identity/auth, dedupe/replay transaction, synthetic agent harness",
    "UM-B3": "um-agent persistence, spool replay, rotation intent, Linux/Windows runtime"
